      "text": "WHEREAS, the Metropolitan Transportation Authority's first phase program provides for the extension of the rapid transit system to Southeast Queens with service for Jamaica Center, York College, and South Jamaica; the removal of the elevated line in central Jamaica; and direct service between Manhattan, Jamaica, and Kennedy Airport - which routings and general plans were established and approved by the Board of Estimate in September 1968;",
